.TH OCOMMENT 1 "August 2026" "ocomment 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ocomment \- check and remove source-code comments safely
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ocomment
.RI [ PATH ...]
.br
.B ocomment
.RI COMMAND " [OPTIONS]"
.SH DESCRIPTION
OComment scans source bytes without requiring UTF-8 and reports or removes
comment tokens. The default policy protects source preambles and tool or
language directives. Rewrites are prepared and committed as one rollback-backed
transaction.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B check [PATH...]
Report removable comments. This is the default command.
.TP
.B fix [PATH...]
Atomically apply safe edits.
.TP
.B diff [PATH...]
Print unified differences.
.TP
.B strip
Read source from standard input and write transformed bytes to standard output.
.TP
.B scan [PATH...]
Print comment spans, kinds, dispositions, diagnostics, edits, and source maps.
.TP
.B lsp
Run the LSP 3.18 server over stdio.
.TP
.B init, config, languages, plugin, completions, doctor
Manage configuration, integrations, plugins, generated completions, and
environment diagnostics.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --format " human|json|jsonl|sarif|github"
Select output format.
.TP
.BI --policy " safe|legal|all"
Select removal policy.
.TP
.BI --layout " lines|columns|compact"
Select replacement layout.
.TP
.BI --language " LANGUAGE"
Override language detection.
.TP
.BI --dialect " DIALECT"
Select a guaranteed language dialect.
.TP
.BI --keep-kind " KIND"
Keep a comment kind. May be repeated or comma separated.
.TP
.BI --remove-kind " KIND"
Remove a comment kind. May be repeated or comma separated.
.TP
.B --force-invalid
Apply known safe spans even when the lexical scan reports invalid input.
.TP
.B --force-protected
Allow the all policy to remove protected comment preambles.
.TP
.B --staged
Operate on comments whose starting delimiter is in a Git index addition.
.TP
.B --index-only
With --staged, update only the Git index.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 means clean or a successful transformation. 1 means check or diff found a
change. 2 means configuration, I/O, source, staged-mapping, or plugin failure.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B .ocomment.toml
Project configuration, version 1.
.TP
.B .ocommentignore
Additional ignore patterns.
.TP
.B .ocomment.lock
Pinned plugin artifacts and identities.
.SH SEE ALSO
The complete schemas and guides are available in the OComment repository.
